					"name": "Boar-Rider",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Snakebite rides a warboar as naturally as he walks.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Riding (Boar); Snakebites are as famous for boarboy cavalry as for squigs.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
