			"name": "Klan: Evil Sunz",
			"local_notes": "Lore: \"Red ones go fasta\": Evil Sunz paint everything red and build for speed, fielding the fastest bikes, buggies and trukks of any Klan.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Klan flavour lens.",
