					"name": "Speed Freak",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An Evil Sunz boy handles fast machines of any kind by instinct.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Piloting (Ork Aircraft); Evil Sunz build and fly the fastest kites too.",
					"tags": [
