					"id": "tuO1Wr9Ydg47BBTYf",
					"name": "Finders Keepers",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Deathskull cannot walk past something shiny and unattended.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": -1
				}
			],
			"disabled": true
		},
		{
			"id": "TokKVP9HMy8Vn1oVv",
			"name": "Klan: Goffs",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Goffs are the biggest, toughest, most melee-obsessed Klan and, by their own account (and most others'), the best fighters of any Ork Klan — Ghazghkull Thraka himself is a Goff.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Klan flavour lens.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Orks"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "t7y5b_fAuzrhnBLG6",
					"name": "Goff Brawler",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Goff has been fighting hand-to-hand since before he could talk properly.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Brawling.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Brawling"
							},
							"amount": 1
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "tQ9yPfU5YoVDt7IoE",
					"name": "Loud and Menacing",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Goffs are the biggest, loudest and most feared boyz in any mob.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Intimidation.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Intimidation"
							},
							"amount": 1
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "t3BFMLYK_h2RIKO2N",
					"name": "Best Fighters, Everyone Knows It",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Goff will not let a claim of toughness from another Klan go unanswered.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": -1
				},
				{
					"id": "tROF7U-QP9pFSPXPr",
					"name": "Black Armour Snob",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Goffs favour black armour and checks, and sneer at gaudy or colourful Klans.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": -1
				}
			],
			"disabled": true
		},
		{
			"id": "TEUdXWOQbp3Ccy-3C",
			"name": "Klan: Bad Moons",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Bad Moons are the richest Klan, trading in teef (Ork currency, quite literally teeth) for the best dakka and gear any Ork can buy — flashy, gold-painted, and widely resented for it.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, per-Klan flavour lens.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Orks"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "teTSbNXmyZylbWc-R",
					"name": "Teef Trader",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Bad Moon knows the going rate for everything, in teef.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Merchant.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Merchant"
							},
							"amount": 1
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "tfdby8Td4oLLFRZV1",
					"name": "Teef-Rich",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Bad Moon always has a little more teef, and a little better kit, than any Klan-mate his size.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), a modest extra stake of teef at the start of play (GM's discretion, about one wealth step for kit purposes, not a Wealth level).",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": 1
				},
				{
					"id": "t_D5n-g7A_erKaZYf",
					"name": "Ostentatious",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Bad Moon cannot resist showing off just how much richer he is than you.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": -1
				},
				{
					"id": "t9Fx1wAHCkt1rsR0O",
					"name": "Gold-Plated Everything",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Bad Moon cannot leave a weapon or helmet un-gilded.\n\nDesign: Quirk (B9), roleplaying flag only.",
					"tags": [
						"Quirk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": -1
				}
			],
			"disabled": true
		},
		{
			"id": "T_-NaWFAM1H_GM2NU",
			"name": "Culture: Freebooterz",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Freebooterz are Ork pirates and void-raiders, more mercenary and more willing to deal (on their own terms) than any Klan — the Orks other factions actually negotiate with, occasionally. They are a way of life rather than a Klan: Freebooterz come from every Klan, so this lens is a culture that can be combined with one Klan lens.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, culture flavour lens (not a Klan), combinable with a Klan lens.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Orks"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tV4kxvZy_KzjGhvf0",
					"name": "Void Raider",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Freebooter has spent as much time raiding from orbit as on the ground.\n\nDesign: Perk (B9), +1 to Piloting (Ork Spacecraft).",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Orks"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
